```
E_disp (ATM twin)            = -0.00099567884677 Ha
E_disp (2b twin)             = -0.00099470623400 Ha
E_total (ATM)                = -34.339247656932827 Ha
E_total (2b)                 = -34.339246684320052 Ha
T_cp2k internal (ATM twin)   = 15.806 s   (1 MPI × 8 OMP)
```

