ΔF = F(ATM) − F(2b) max component ≈ 4.19e−7 Ha/Bohr.
Cross-check vs dftd4 3.7.0 ATM force increment: max |Δ| ≈ 2.4e−8 Ha/Bohr
(the known periodic ATM gradient defect / cutoff parity floor).
